==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|frm|inimitable}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|inimitabilis}}, corresponding to {{prefix|in|imitable|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪnˈɪmɪtəbl̩/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|?}}

# Beyond [[imitation]], [[surpassing]] all others, [[matchless]].

====Usage notes====
Not to be confused with {{m|en|inimicable||[[inimical]], harmful, hostile}}.

====Derived terms====
* [[inimitability]]
* [[inimitably]]

====Antonyms====
* [[imitable]]
* [[commonplace]]

